Cac file duoi day duoc sao chep tu repo tren VA DA BI SUA DOI:

    commands/architecture.md
        nguon: engineering/skills/architecture/SKILL.md
        sua:   them lop ghi file va danh so ADR, them rang buoc giai doan PLAN,
               them muc "nam cua mot chieu", bo phan connector, dich sang
               tieng Viet.

    commands/design-handoff.md
        nguon: design/skills/design-handoff/SKILL.md
        sua:   doi nguon dau vao tu Figma sang plan.md, them lop ghi
               contracts/ui.md va design-tokens.json, them "bon trang thai bat
               buoc" (co trang thai du lieu cu), them ban do ma loi sang chu
               hien thi, bo phan connector, dich sang tieng Viet.

    commands/write-spec.md
        nguon: product-management/skills/write-spec/SKILL.md
        sua:   doi tu "viet PRD tu dau" sang "lam day spec.md da co", them lop
               ghi file, them rang buoc giai doan SPEC, rut gon, dich sang
               tieng Viet.

    commands/system-design.md
        nguon: engineering/skills/system-design/SKILL.md
        sua:   them khuon output va lop ghi docs/02-architecture.md, them rang
               buoc giai doan PLAN, them luat tach quyet dinh mot chieu thanh
               ADR rieng, dich sang tieng Viet.

    commands/design-system.md
        nguon: design/skills/design-system/SKILL.md
        sua:   doi nguon doi chieu sang contracts/ui.md va design-tokens.json,
               them lop ghi contracts/ui-audit.md, them buoc quet gia tri
               hard-code trong code, bo phan connector, dich sang tieng Viet.

    commands/a11y.md
        nguon: design/skills/accessibility-review/SKILL.md
        sua:   doi nguon vao tu Figma sang spec/plan/contracts, them lop ghi
               specs/NNN/a11y-review.md, them luat phan biet FAIL va GAP, bo
               phan connector, dich sang tieng Viet.

Moi file khac trong extension nay la ban goc.

